        <id>364</id>
        <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
          <name>UseItForAutocorrectInOrders</name>
          <id>366</id>
          <visible>true</visible>
          <enabled>true</enabled>
          <userVisible>
            <common>true</common>
          </userVisible>
          <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
            <segments>Object.UseItForAutocorrectInOrders</segments>
          </dataPath>
          <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
          <toolTip>
            <key>en</key>
            <value>When the option is enabled, the сhange order will be automatically applied in the dynamic order structure when generating production stages. If the option is disabled, the сhange order can only be applied manually through the substitute picking form.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>fa</key>
            <value>هنگامی که گزینه فعال باشد، دستور تغییر هنگام ایجاد مراحل تولید به‌طور خودکار در ساختار پویای سفارش اعمال خواهد شد. اگر گزینه غیرفعال باشد، دستور تغییر فقط به‌صورت دستی از طریق فرم انتخاب جایگزین قابل اعمال است.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>ru</key>
            <value>При включенной опции разрешение на замену будет автоматически применятся в динамической структуре заказа, при формировании этапов производства. При выключенной опции разрешение на замену можно будет применить только вручную через форму подбора аналогов.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>tr</key>
            <value>Etkinleştirildiğinde değiştirme izni üretim aşamalarının oluşturulması sırasında sipariş dinamik yapısında otomatik uygulanır. Devre dışı bırakıldığında değiştirme izni yalnızca ikameler seçim formu üzerinden manuel olarak uygulanabilir.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>it</key>
            <value>When the option is enabled, the сhange order will be automatically applied in the dynamic order structure when generating production stages. If the option is disabled, the сhange order can only be applied manually through the substitute picking form.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>pl</key>
            <value>When the option is enabled, the сhange order will be automatically applied in the dynamic order structure when generating production stages. If the option is disabled, the сhange order can only be applied manually through the substitute picking form.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTip>
            <key>vi</key>
            <value>When the option is enabled, the сhange order will be automatically applied in the dynamic order structure when generating production stages. If the option is disabled, the сhange order can only be applied manually through the substitute picking form.</value>
          </toolTip>
          <toolTipRepresentation>Button</toolTipRepresentation>
